235
00:18:40.915 --> 00:18:44.377
Kaya kong maglinis palagi
kapag nagsimula na itong madumi.

236
00:18:46.671 --> 00:18:48.297
Pero tinatakot mo ba ako ngayon?

237
00:18:48.381 --> 00:18:50.174
Naparito ako para balaan ka.

238
00:18:50.424 --> 00:18:54.011
Hindi kasi ako pwedeng umupo na lang
see you or Ah-jin ulit.

239
00:18:54.804 --> 00:18:55.847
Pagkatapos kong mag isip

240
00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:59.600
