399
00:32:45.884 --> 00:32:48.845
Hindi nagtagal,
may balitang ikakasal na siya sa isang conglomerate.

400
00:32:53.141 --> 00:32:54.518
Sabi ko, "Ano?"

401
00:32:59.523 --> 00:33:02.317
Ang testimonya na ito tungkol kay Baek Ah-jin

402
00:33:02.401 --> 00:33:04.611
