414
00:33:43.316 --> 00:33:45.152
BAEK AH-JIN
ANTISOCIAL PERSONALITY DISORDER

415
00:33:45.235 --> 00:33:46.403
Naalala ko yung kaso.

416
00:33:46.486 --> 00:33:48.530
